   "title": "Which A1c target? Weigh fewer complications against HYPOGLYCEMIA",
   "lines": [
    "minimum for EVERY patient: free of symptomatic highs AND lows",
    "decide WITH the patient: benefit vs lows, out-of-pocket cost, feasibility"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "g_tight",
   "x": 45,
   "y": 138,
   "w": 512,
   "h": 60,
   "kind": "plain",
   "title": "Severe lows UNLIKELY: prevent complications",
   "lines": [
    "the more years ahead, the more there is to prevent"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "g_lib",
   "x": 597,
   "y": 138,
   "w": 512,
   "h": 60,
   "kind": "plain",
   "title": "Lows LIKELY or DANGEROUS, or life SHORT: LIBERALIZE",
   "lines": [
    "the main side effect of insulin and secretagogues is hypoglycemia"
   ]
  },
